{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_otter_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_otter_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"滿滿的日程表","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_otter_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"4ebab26a99c493547486383c6aacea1f871d5e91ae3d33d6c034843da6589afe","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"个人剧情 梅尔"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"羅德島本艦\n“魯特拉工作室”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，時間差不多了嘛，該開始幹活了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我看看今天的日程表。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，還行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"答應麥麥的“龍騰無人機操作改進方案”今天截稿，一會收個尾，然後等她來就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷婭的防護服檢修委託？主要是刷新塗料吧......糟了，我是不是沒訂塗料？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——還好還好，上次的沒用完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"今天主要就做這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"如果還有空閒，就發幾份新零件的訂單出去，然後給服役的咪波們好好維護一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，今天就做這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"開工啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"梅爾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"梅爾快開門啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有急事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷婭這件衣服不太對勁啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"充能率怎麼都上不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，到底是哪裡出問題了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"梅爾，我知道你在裡面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我都聽見你聲音了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"是這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈~果然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"找到癥結問題就好處理了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是你逼我的啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"只要修復失效節點，整件衣服應該就能重新工作了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼，先優化充能路線，然後上塗料，馬上就能恢復到正常運作狀態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"要不要再順帶加點額外功能呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"//（开门的音效）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，不知道亂用權限會不會被凱爾希罵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"不管了，要怪就怪梅爾裝聾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"梅爾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"搞定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"節點位置再檢查一遍吧，一會上塗料滲進去就麻煩了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"幹活戴耳機，就不怕被人嚇到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"（拍梅爾肩膀）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"（張嘴咬人）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚啊啊啊啊！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"好疼好疼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"鬆口，快鬆口啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"我不好吃啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"好過分喔梅爾，難得有好事情找你，不幫我開門就算了，還咬我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉啦可露希爾，你又不是不知道我工作的時候被打擾會咬人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嗚嗚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"那我也給你咬一下，好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在是不是在給衣服上抗源石塗料？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"那還是算了，現在咬你一口，下一秒就得進醫療部，不划算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好像是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"門怎麼關不上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得特地設置過自動開關，剛剛還調成請勿打擾來著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是你把門禁給駭了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會~~我就這樣走進來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"是你門沒鎖啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒鎖嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"你等一下，我看看監控錄影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"梅爾你裝監控的嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"我這裡很多東西都是萊茵內部資料啊，萬一丟了什麼東西對大家都不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"基本保險措施還是需要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"現在還是先工作吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"注意，注意安全操作規程啊。這個塗料，挺危險的吧，你這樣三心二意，會出事的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，我用機械臂呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，是哪個程式來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"額，梅爾，塗料的性質是不是要變化了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說這個？還好啦，這是惰性塗料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"就算浸水燒開電離三小時再凍住，只要一解凍，馬上就能用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"是這個資料夾嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"ok，監控程序打開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"把時間拖到——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"梅爾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"不和我一起做智慧型機器人嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"梅爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"梅，梅爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛剛說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"再，再說一遍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"和我一起做智慧型機器人好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"那詳情我們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"（按下開關播放監控影片）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"滋——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"監控影片","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（開門的音效）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"監控影片","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，不知道亂用權限會不會被凱爾希罵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"監控影片","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不管了，要怪就怪梅爾裝聾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"咬她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊我錯了別用咪波啊好疼好疼哇啊啊！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"說吧，大概需要我做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嗚嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"我想要你幫我搞一下爆炸方面的東西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"基座機器是雷神挑釁者熔岩貓魔鬼高性能版作業平台......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"上面已經有一個定制的全量熱力法術衝擊發生器了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"但那個效果不太理想，所以需要你幫幫忙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嗚嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"哦好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"你先聞一下這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"好的嗚嗚嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"（吸氣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"這是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"（深吸一口氣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"好了沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊~~~~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"欸嘿嘿嘿，謝謝梅爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"你再這樣哭下去沒法談生意啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"也是也是，嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道你為什麼那麼喜歡聞我這裡的精煉潤滑油......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"那當然是因為好聞啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"看來華法琳說的沒錯，你血管裡沒有血，只有機油。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"不說了，談正事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"是需要我給雷神挑釁者做改裝，提高攻擊能力對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"還有自我防衛、受擊抗性和戰場脫離方案的設計，畢竟是要植入智慧的好傢伙，可不能用一次就壞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"那你是找對人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，報酬呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"你記不記得機庫那裡有一間小儲物間啊，只要你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"這份差事我接了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，合作愉快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"愉快愉快~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"但是呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到那邊的黑板了嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"貼滿紙的那塊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"那是我的排期表。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"就算加急，你的需求也在最後一張紙的右下角。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"能再插個隊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，兩個月之後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"快的話五十天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"你工作速度那麼快的嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"還好吧，有時候靈感一來工作就做完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......那我不打擾你了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"加油工作哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"你先幫我把門格式化，我要重新調整。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，把你的最高權限去掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"現在、立刻、馬上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"好......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩小時後"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"還有最後一小塊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"叮咚"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"梅爾，是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你換密碼了嗎，門怎麼開不了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"這下應該差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？門口有誰在嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"麥麥！門壞了！按門旁按鈕進來吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"你好呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"我這邊還在忙塞雷婭的東西，就不招待你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，找我有事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是有預約的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"無人機方案，做得怎麼樣啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，已經做完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"列舉了一點技術要點、改進方案和材料需求，全都在桌上的那個文件袋裡了，你先看看，沒有問題就可以約新時間幫你做些配件了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"要是有問題的話我們找個時間聊聊細節。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"好呀，謝謝梅爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"那是哪張桌子的哪個文件袋呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"那個那個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"你機械臂指的位置至少有四張桌子，我怎麼知道是哪個嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"梅爾——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"啊別拉，我還在弄塗料！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"塗料過一會也可以塗的，先幫我找找文件袋好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"梅爾~~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，謝謝~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——是這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"這個是你上個月的報銷清單哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"啊抱歉，其實是這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"對了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你梅爾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼啦，應該的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"那我先走了，拜拜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"最重要的事差點忘記了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"我問你，現在幾點了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"中午吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"是下午！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"梅爾，你吃飯了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？我嘛？我吃根能量棒就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"那怎麼行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"給，拿著！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"這是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"食堂買的，今天有你喜歡吃的河鮮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"本來想請你一起吃的，結果我自己也把時間忙忘了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"所以吃完以後打包了一份過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"一定要吃啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"還有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"這是塞雷婭的充能護服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"你大概還要做多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"一兩個小時吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不行，我幫你一起弄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，我可以的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"要嘛讓我幫你一起弄，要嘛我餵你吃飯，選吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"好了我知道了拜託你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"嘻嘻~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們就開工吧~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，完工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"過來洗手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"好——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......也就只有這個時候，才會懷念萊茵的全自動清潔設備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"那為什麼不回去呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"回去了就要被安排一大堆麻煩的工作，都沒時間改進咪波。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，在那邊還要處理人際關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡也需要啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"你出外勤比較多，對部門間的爭鬥不熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"在那裡啊，今天認識個新朋友，回頭就會有人和你說：“這個人是某某部門的關係，你離他遠點比較好。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"更可怕的是，就算同一個部門，有時候也要因為上司間的競爭關係爾虞我詐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"我是真的不擅長應付這些事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"所以就溜到這裡來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，我不該問這些的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"好，吃飯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"那我也該離開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波，麻煩你監督她一下，不然我一走她又要直接開始幹活了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波沒裝語音模組，不會回應你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"那也得叮囑一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，這次是真的要走了，拜拜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"拜拜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，要不先訂好零件再吃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇，咪波你要幹什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"只是先幹一會活，不會忘記吃飯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"好我知道了，我吃，現在就吃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，飽了。好，幹活！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，先訂材料還是先修咪波？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"還是先咪波好了，咪波比較重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"補漆、檢查佈線、資料更新、補充能源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"維護一隻大概需要做這些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"出任務的還有4隻，備用的5隻也要維護。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"現在幾點來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"看來今天能搞定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"應該能搞定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"只要別再有人——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"梅爾！開門！！有事找你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"——————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼又~！@~#！@"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"吸氣——呼氣，吸氣——呼氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"微笑~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"呦，你在啊梅爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"遇上什麼好事了笑那麼開心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"你過來，我告訴你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，這是咪波。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"把手伸過來，有好東西給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，真是稀奇，是什麼好東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"咪波，咬他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊別咬我疼疼疼疼疼！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"深夜"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——終於。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"完成了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"今天早上的計畫全部完成！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——那個不算，我剛剛決定把訂零件的工作移到明天了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我來看看明天要做些什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"去採購部訂些零件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"要給醫療部安裝實驗裝置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，工作台也要重新調試一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"明天就做這些吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"現在是......11點36分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，是該休息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"吃碗泡麵就睡覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"明天見，咪波。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咪波","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"啊好疼！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_007_closre","aliases":["？？？","可露希爾"]},{"speakerId":"char_242_mayer","aliases":["？？？","梅爾"]},{"speakerId":"char_248_mgllan","aliases":["麥哲倫"]}]}
